=== 10-07 fix commits
52942c3 fix(web): accessibility and request-budget findings from the 2026-10-07 test audit
commit 52942c308d67ed0621b5b5145d429facc6ea422f
Author: George Mgebrishvili <332516663+Georgemgebbrishvili@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 23:03:10 2026 +0400

    fix(web): accessibility and request-budget findings from the 2026-10-07 test audit
    
    - Observatory facts: each fact is its own <dl> of one <dt> and one <dd>, beside its icon;
      axe's definition-list and dlitem rules flagged the wrapper and icons inside the list.
    - Mission progress on a phone: the bar's step number is transparent at every state's
      specificity, so the current step no longer paints it at 1.62:1 on orange, and the dot
      is hidden from assistive technology, which reads the step from the list.
    - Status table: the overflowing wrapper is a labelled, focusable region with the focus
      ring, so WebKit's keyboard reaches and scrolls it.
    - platformRequest gives up after 10 s and apiRequest after 15 s, and each fails as an
      unreachable platform already does. The live channels do not go through either.

